# PHASE 3 – PROJECT DESIGN PHASE

## Project Name

**Employee Data Import and Management System Using ServiceNow**

## 1. Introduction

The Project Design Phase defines the structure, workflow, data flow, and components of the Employee Data Import and Management System.

The system is designed to import employee information from an Excel spreadsheet into ServiceNow using Import Sets and Transform Maps.

## 2. System Architecture

The system follows a structured data import architecture.

```text
Employee
Spreadsheet
     ↓
Load Data
     ↓
Import Set Table
     ↓
Transform Map
     ↓
Field Mapping
     ↓
Employee Test Table
     ↓
Employee Records
```

