## 4. Workflow Design

The project follows the following workflow:

```text
Start
  ↓
Prepare Employee Spreadsheet
  ↓
Load Data into ServiceNow
  ↓
Create Import Set
  ↓
Create Transform Map
  ↓
Map Source and Target Fields
  ↓
Transform Data
  ↓
Verify Employee Records
  ↓
End
```

