## 6. Field Mapping Design

The source and target fields are designed to have the following mapping:

| Source Field  | Target Field  |
| ------------- | ------------- |
| Employee ID   | Employee ID   |
| Employee Name | Employee Name |
| Department    | Department    |
| Email         | Email         |
| Location      | Location      |

