## 7. Design Summary

The design provides a clear flow for transferring employee information from the spreadsheet to the Employee Test table.

The design ensures that each source field is mapped to its corresponding target field before the data is transformed.

## 8. Conclusion

The Project Design Phase defines the architecture, workflow, data flow, table structure, and field mapping required for the Employee Data Import and Management System.

The design will be implemented in the Project Development Phase.
